{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/867575-promethean-ghost-and-the-fivefold-soul","id":867575,"title":"Promethean ghost and the Fivefold Soul","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-18T08:19:37-07:00","id":867575,"title":"Promethean ghost and the Fivefold Soul","content":"I just wanted to share the story I came up with, part of my Mage chronicle.<ul><li>So...Pino was once a Promethean. His throng and him got separated because of events, and he ended up being taken care of by a cabal of mages. Pino wanted to go back to his throng, but could not do so on his own. The cabal tried in many ways to do so, but failed.</li> <li>As a last trump card, Orlando, a Moros who got influenced by Disquiet, decided with the rest of the cabal that they where going to summon a good quantity of acamoth in search for an answer for Pino's search, and getting him back to his family. Eventually, he got really mad, and decided to end Pino's miserable life by sacrificing him to the Abyss.The cabal eventually dissolved for internal warfare and the individual mages went to other cabals, leaving the Sanctum. Orlando is still somewhere, and is a Scelestus.</li> <li>Prometheans who die for the first time go to the Underworld, to face their mistakes, people they hurted and so on, and eventually come back.</li> <li>We know with Mummy that the Soul is made of 5 parts. Ab (heart), Ba (spirit), Ka (essence), Ren (name), Sheut (Shadow). Promethean don't have a true soul, they have the Divine Fire, but it slowly turns into a soul until Humanity is reached.</li> <li>Pino was used as a sacrifice to the Abyss, and we know the Abyss messes things up. So the Sheut part of Pino's Divine Fire was left behind, leaving a ghost. The rest of the Divine Fire is still in the Underworld, trying to resurface to 